@startuml
title SGHC - C3: Infraestructura y Monitoreo
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  BorderColor #2563EB
  RoundCorner 15
}

rectangle "Infraestructura & Observabilidad" as IM {
  component "Prometheus Exporter" as Prom
  component "Grafana Dashboards" as Graf
  component "ArgoCD Pipeline" as Argo
  component "OpenTelemetry Collector" as OT
  component "Alertmanager" as AM
}

actor "DevOps / SRE" as DevOps
Prom --> Graf : Métricas en tiempo real
OT --> Prom : Exportar trazas
Argo --> IM : Despliegue automatizado
AM --> DevOps : Notificaciones incidentes

note right of IM
Supervisa la plataforma, automatiza despliegues
y mantiene observabilidad centralizada (IaC + GitOps).
end note
@enduml
